OL,3,CWoman allegedly got into bed with
OL,4,Csleeping boy for sex, court hears
OL,6,FA man has told Jersey's Royal Court
OL,7,Fthat he was sexually abused by a woman
OL,8,Fwhen he was 14 years old.
OL,10,FThe alleged historical sexual offences
OL,11,Finclude two counts of indecent assault
OL,12,Fand are said to have taken place in
OL,13,Fthe early 1990s, when the woman was in
OL,14,Fher twenties.
OL,16,FDonna Bentley, who is 53 and a
OL,17,Fregistered care manager in the island,
OL,18,Fdenies all the charges against her -
OL,19,Fwhich do not relate to her employment.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
