OL,3,CWoman allegedly got into bed with
OL,4,Csleeping boy for sex, court hears
OL,6,FMs Bentley was arrested after she went
OL,7,Fto police to complain about nuisance
OL,8,Fmessages from the man who claims she
OL,9,Fhad had sex with him twice while he
OL,10,Fwas a child.
OL,12,FHe states that, on one occasion, Ms
OL,13,FBentley had entered his room uninvited
OL,14,Fand got into bed with him while he was
OL,15,Fsleeping.
OL,17,FA friend of the alleged victim told
OL,18,Fthe jury that he witnessed what he
OL,19,Fbelieved to have been two people
OL,20,Fhaving sex in the bed while he was
OL,21,Fstaying over for a sleepover.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
