OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1785343679
OL,3,CWoman allegedly got into bed with
OL,4,Csleeping boy for sex, court hears
OL,6,FThe friend told the court he was about
OL,7,F13 at the time.
OL,9,FGiving evidence on Tuesday 28 July,
OL,10,Fthe alleged victim admitted to sending
OL,11,Ftexts to Ms Bentley in 2020 after he
OL,12,Fhad been drinking heavily, in an
OL,13,Fattempt to understand the abuse he
OL,14,Fclaims took place.
OL,16,FThe messages included an invitation to
OL,17,Fmeet up in-person and threats to go to
OL,18,Fthe police about 'what you done to
OL,19,Fme', adding, 'the clock is ticking'.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
