OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1785343679
OL,3,CWoman allegedly got into bed with
OL,4,Csleeping boy for sex, court hears
OL,6,FHe told the court he wanted an
OL,7,Fexplanation from the defendant.
OL,9,FThe man says it took him a couple of
OL,10,Fyears of being sober to find the
OL,11,Fcourage to go to the police, stating
OL,12,Fhe stopped drinking alcohol in 2021.
OL,14,FHe also claims that, at the time of
OL,15,Fthe alleged offences, he saw Ms
OL,16,FBentley having sex with him as a badge
OL,17,Fof honour and did not see it as abuse
OL,18,Funtil he was in his thirties.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
