OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1785343679
OL,3,CWoman allegedly got into bed with
OL,4,Csleeping boy for sex, court hears
OL,6,FThe defence told the court that Ms
OL,7,FBentley admitted to kissing her
OL,8,Falleged victim once in 1998, when he
OL,9,Fwas older, and that things went no
OL,10,Ffurther.
OL,12,FThe trial continues and Ms Bentley
OL,13,Fdenies all charges against her.
